  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|145642",
      "en": "You must talk to the Council to gain access to the Wards.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|148499",
      "en": "The keeper scan has been uploaded to the database.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|148500",
      "en": "You do not have the proper keycard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|163019",
      "en": "Get to the Quarian and warn her before it's too late!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81903",
      "en": "Welcome to Flux. Name's Doran. What can I do for you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81904",
      "en": "Owner, cook, and bartender. I've even been known to dance a little when the mood strikes me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81905",
      "en": "Enjoy your time here at Flux.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81906",
      "en": "Among other things, yes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81910",
      "en": "Let me see that. You got that from Schells, didn't you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81912",
      "en": "I saw him using it earlier. Tossed him out on his ass for it, too. Thanks for bringing this to me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81913",
      "en": "I agree with you on that. Thanks again. Take a few shots at the quasar, on the house.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81914",
      "en": "I suppose it is. Take a few tries of quasar, on the house.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81916",
      "en": "Hello again. Can I help you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81917",
      "en": "Well, Jenna left to work at Chora's Den. Now her sister Rita is all worried she might be in some kind of trouble. ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81919",
      "en": "Not much chance Jenna will change her mind, though. She's a stubborn one.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81925",
      "en": "Are you the owner?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81926",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81927",
      "en": "Is this a casino?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81931",
      "en": "I've got something you might be interested in.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81934",
      "en": "Cheaters shouldn't prosper.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81935",
      "en": "I think that tool should be worth something to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81937",
      "en": "Just passing through.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81938",
      "en": "What can you tell me about the sisters working for you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81941",
      "en": "I should be going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81947",
      "en": "You own this place?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81948",
      "en": "Nothing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81949",
      "en": "Flux",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81953",
      "en": "[Give him Schells' tool.]",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81958",
      "en": "No problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81959",
      "en": "Payment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81960",
      "en": "Nope.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81961",
      "en": "Rita and Jenna",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|81964",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|89505",
      "en": "We've got some quasar stations if you're interested.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|89506",
      "en": "If she wanted to come back, I'd take her in a second. The customers loved her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_doran_D|113765",
      "en": "I'm watching you. No more tricks or you'll be out on your ass too.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_ai_conv1_D|136947",
      "en": "I believe this machine has been tampered with, and someone is funneling credits to a private account. I will attempt to trace the signal.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_ai_conv1_D|136948",
      "en": "I think somebody rigged this machine to funnel credits through the system. Let me trace the signal.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_ai_conv1_D|136949",
      "en": "Someone rigged this machine to funnel credits their way. I'll run a trace.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_ai_conv1_D|136950",
      "en": "Someone rigged this machine to funnel credits their way. I'll run a trace.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_ai_conv1_D|136951",
      "en": "Someone rigged this machine to funnel credits their way. I'll run a trace.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_ai_conv1_D|136952",
      "en": "Someone rigged this machine to funnel credits their way.  I'll trace it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89544",
      "en": "I need to speak with you a moment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89545",
      "en": "You've got the same device Schells had earlier. Did he give it to you, or did you take it from him?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89546",
      "en": "Never mind. It doesn't matter how you got it. But I can't let you keep it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89547",
      "en": "Don't make a scene, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89548",
      "en": "Now, I suggest you stick to playing the game fairly, or not at all.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89549",
      "en": "Your luck seems... unnatural, human.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89550",
      "en": "Don't often see someone getting as lucky as you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89553",
      "en": "I don't think you're going to take it from me.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89554",
      "en": "I don't know what you're talking about.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89555",
      "en": "I'm not hurting anyone.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89559",
      "en": "Too bad.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89560",
      "en": "What device?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|89561",
      "en": "Why not?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_09casino_DSG_LOC|sta60_trig_doran_reacts_D|104675",
      "en": "I've already recovered the credits you won.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
}